OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 3 DEC
OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GElizabeth Alker marks the 90th
OL,6,     Gbirthday of the BBC Scottish
OL,7,     GSymphony Orchestra, she also has
OL,8,     Gexclusive recordings of great
OL,9,     GRomantic violin concertos and
OL,10,     Gchamber music from Sweden.
OL,11,G1500FChoral Evensong
OL,12,     GChoral Vespers from Arundel
OL,13,     GCathedral, with music by James
OL,14,     GMacMillan, Bevan, Mendelssohn and
OL,15,     GOldroyd.
OL,16,G1600FComposer of the Week: John Rutter
OL,17,     GDonald Macleod speaks to John
OL,18,     GRutter about his extraordinary
OL,19,     Gmusical career in his 80th
OL,20,     Gbirthday year. Today, John talks
OL,21,     Gabout his long association with
OL,22,     GAmerica.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
