OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 3 DEC
OL,4,G1700FIn Tune
OL,5,     GCellist Natalie Clein and pianist
OL,6,     GGeorge Todica, plus an interview
OL,7,     Gwith Tom Service.
OL,8,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,9,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,10,     Gsoundscape of classical music
OL,11,     Gfrom composers such as
OL,12,     GRachmaninov, Purcell and Spohr.
OL,13,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,14,     GThe BBC Philharmonic is joined by
OL,15,     GGemma New for Sibelius, Bacewicz
OL,16,     Gand a UK premiere by Gabriella
OL,17,     GSmith.
