OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 3 DEC
OL,4,G2145FThe Essay: Electronic Women
OL,5,     GHannah Peel delves into the
OL,6,     Gstories and sound worlds of five
OL,7,     Gfemale electronic pioneers.
OL,8,     GTonight, Eliane Radigue: pioneer,
OL,9,     Gmystic, and explorer of new
OL,10,     Gmusical consciousness.
OL,11,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,12,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,13,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,14,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,15,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,16,     Geverything in between.
OL,17,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,18,     GVenna is back with his third pick
OL,19,     Gof the week, and tonight he goes
OL,20,     Gfor a release that features some
OL,21,     Gof the contemporary artists he
OL,22,     Greveres.
